Package: icpim
Title: Access the ICP Integrated Monitoring Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("James", "Weldon", , "weldondesign@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("ICP Integrated Monitoring Programme Centre", role = "dtc",
           comment = "Data collection and curation"),
    person("Swedish University of Agricultural Sciences", role = "cph",
           comment = "Publisher of the underlying dataset"))
Description: Download, cache and tidy the open dataset of the International
    Cooperative Programme on Integrated Monitoring of Air Pollution Effects on
    Ecosystems (ICP IM), published by the Swedish University of Agricultural
    Sciences at <doi:10.5878/z376-2m63>. The dataset holds long-term integrated
    ecosystem monitoring from forested catchments in 14 European countries,
    covering atmospheric chemistry, deposition, soil, soil water, groundwater,
    runoff, vegetation and biota. Functions resolve and cache the published
    files, read them with the correct column types, and decode the substance,
    parameter, determination and pretreatment code lists into readable names.
    Several encoding traps in the published files are handled explicitly, most
    importantly the substance code for sodium, which is the literal string
    "NA".
